        {"@type":"Question","name":'What if I lose my arrival card during my stay?',"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Losing your arrival card isn't a major issue, but keep the departure stub safely with your passport. You'll need to present it when leaving China. If you lose the departure card, the immigration officer may ask a few extra questions."}},
